  "validation_scope": "Final source/test files pass17 DynamicArray integration targets, DynamicArray unit filter, strict Clippy and fmt. Focused strict-provenance Miri validates actual metadata reads during Drop and original-slot lifetime retirement; original52 and initialized-tail unit regressions run under Miri as well. Compiler binding is unique, public and body-bearing; archives capture source, outputs and source hashes. No shared ledger or raw lifetime helper edits."
